 "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827585_28341938315465098_8809741145785461081_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_oOzV2MByqIQ7kNvwHThdRc&_nc_oc=AdoEg_gBCZkK3d9r5mcExFkg9MCZvTlq7CBavNA9MG7UQIjW-IkHqqKM94Rhb93CAC4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOM5PJzPl4BzGarAOSBjqfJfke1LSw1Mr1JsCuQH_LI-Q&oe=6AE20CD2"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2.png", "id": "1363490022520248", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821704_1363490025853581_5604524681396743543_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=giVxUdCZhgYQ7kNvwHdL24v&_nc_oc=AdpzLb8mdwUT6RQa6sTxl9oFb7S838WPLUQsk-kOVEJM77tbcsROaWxpM1bKxY1maoI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNSgFD19SWNefDOuXrDLnkH79jTcc43QD8JjSaNlf7iqQ&oe=6AE1EA65"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "4781042735485681", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823949_4781042738819014_8615788518980294368_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7aHUB2ZH0nIQ7kNvwHbIEdu&_nc_oc=Adr4sc5CBMufSYzwPz6xMZ_-4bjfVzktBuhduiRyvvdW_i2TK03LJlfolwWtXQjJXTI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMLUDLFpsQnDJETumCgMNoe_a8_gmsYMvbC9d8mXZpwAw&oe=6AE1FAF1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Screenshot 2.png", "id": "5470892426468281", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827973_5470892429801614_3601838845378972880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AlNBVEH_srQQ7kNvwGTq9Z-&_nc_oc=AdqaWDJUZZKKPI2Y4X_D8xnndEtV4NA55J95E3HJb3zeBMs1oxV_MmF7jXBpvCaSQqQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMt5bVv7AYOdZqFdOGB-yaoN2_VIk98gnKrRYzZxg5fhA&oe=6AE20068"}, "display_name": "Viscer Medical II", "keywords": ["Medical", "Simulation", "Nursing", "Education", "Training"], "long_description": "VisceR Medical II is an immersive VR clinical training experience designed for medical students, residents, and healthcare professionals. It provides a safe, repeatable environment to learn and practice essential diagnostic and procedural skills without risk to patients.\n\nThe pack includes procedures across Dermatovenerology, Anesthesiology, and Oncology. \n\nDERMATOVENEROLOGY\n\u2022 Dermatitis\n\u2022 Eczema\n\u2022 Psoriasis\n\u2022 Vitiligo\n\u2022 Syphilis\n\u2022 Gonorrhea\n\nANESTHESIOLOGY\n\u2022 Spinal Anesthesia\n\nONCOLOGY\n\u2022 Skin Cancer\n\nThrough interactive VR simulations, learners can understand procedural steps, practice clinical techniques, identify errors, and build confidence through repeated practice. VisceR complements classroom teaching, clinical demonstrations, skills-lab training, and supervised clinical education.\n\nVisceR Medical II is part of the wider VisceR healthcare education ecosystem. Additional VisceR packs cover other medical specialties, nursing departments, clinical skills, surgical procedures, anatomy, diagnostics, and other areas of healthcare education.\n\nLearn by doing, practice repeatedly, and build clinical confidence with VisceR.\n", "short_description": "VisceR Medical II is an immersive VR clinical training experience for medical students, residents, and healthcare professionals. Practice essential procedures across Dermatovenerology, Anesthesiology, Oncology. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.viscer.co/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Simutomy Medtech Pvt Ltd", "support_website_url": "https://www.viscer.co/contact", "website_url": "https://www.viscer.co/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "478089301798119"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVE